#. Combustible Gas
msgctxt "HeliumExtractor.PHO_STRINGS.COMBUSTIBLEGAS"
msgid "Combustible Gas"
msgstr "可燃气体"

#. <b><color=#9C2724>Helium</color></b> has the lowest liquefaction temperature of all elements and the highest <style="KKeyword">thermal conductivity</style> of gases.
msgctxt "HeliumExtractor.PHO_STRINGS.HELIUMEXTRACTOR.DESC"
msgid "<b><color=#9C2724>Helium</color></b> has the lowest liquefaction temperature of all elements and the highest <style=\"KKeyword\">thermal conductivity</style> of gases."
msgstr "<b><color=#9C2724>氦气</color></b>是所有元素中液化温度最低的，并且在气体中具有最高的<style=\"KKeyword\">导热率</style>。"

#. Decompose <link="METHANE">Natural Gas</link> into <link="HELIUM">Helium</link>, <link="PROPANE">Propane</link> and <link="SULFUR">Sulfur</link>.    <b><color=#9C2724>Helium</color></b> is a useful gas with interesting physical properties.    <b><color=#7990D1>Propane</color></b> can be used the same way than <b><color=#FF6E0F>Natural gas</color></b>, in a <link="GOURMETCOOKINGSTATION">Gourmet Cooking Station</link>, <link="METHANEGENERATOR">Natural Gas Generator</link> or in a <link="FOODDEHYDRATOR">Food Dehydrator</link>.
msgctxt "HeliumExtractor.PHO_STRINGS.HELIUMEXTRACTOR.EFFECT"
msgid "Decompose <link=\"METHANE\">Natural Gas</link> into <link=\"HELIUM\">Helium</link>, <link=\"PROPANE\">Propane</link> and <link=\"SULFUR\">Sulfur</link>.\n\n<b><color=#9C2724>Helium</color></b> is a useful gas with interesting physical properties.\n\n<b><color=#7990D1>Propane</color></b> can be used the same way than <b><color=#FF6E0F>Natural gas</color></b>, in a <link=\"GOURMETCOOKINGSTATION\">Gourmet Cooking Station</link>, <link=\"METHANEGENERATOR\">Natural Gas Generator</link> or in a <link=\"FOODDEHYDRATOR\">Food Dehydrator</link>."
msgstr "将<link=\"METHANE\">天然气</link>分解为<link=\"HELIUM\">氦气</link>、<link=\"PROPANE\">丙烷</link>和<link=\"SULFUR\">硫磺</link>。\n\n<b><color=#9C2724>氦气</color></b>是一种具有有趣物理性质的有用气体。\n\n<b><color=#7990D1>丙烷</color></b>可以像<b><color=#FF6E0F>天然气</color></b>一样使用，用于<link=\"GOURMETCOOKINGSTATION\">美食烹饪台</link>、<link=\"METHANEGENERATOR\">天然气发电机</link>或<link=\"FOODDEHYDRATOR\">食物脱水机</link>。"

#. Helium Extractor
msgctxt "HeliumExtractor.PHO_STRINGS.HELIUMEXTRACTOR.NAME"
msgid "Helium Extractor"
msgstr "氦气提取器"